 # `cp -r ~/config sharedConfig` of install state 31 left a link back to the
 # folder on tampered VMs. config.init.shared and state 31 call it. Canonical
 # paths compared, so a relative link (`.`) is one too (T-THIS-SELFLOOP-REMOVE).
